o white, and double-buffered text composites as if drawn directly instead of with darkened anti-aliased edges. Widget backbuffers are labelled premultiplied but hold straight colour, which is how every consumer reads them (GPU and CPU image blits, icons), so ImageGraphics2D fills them with straight source-over (new internal BlenderStraightOverBGRA, C++ blender_rgba_plain) through a new internal StraightOverImageProxy placed under a clipping proxy carrying the destination's clip box - the buffer and its blender are never changed, and ImageBuffer's own solid blends keep their C++ premultiplied contract. The SVG renderer, whose layers are genuinely premultiplied and whose paint is already premultiplied, fills through ScanlineRenderer directly. ThemeTokenDefaultsTests hashes re-captured (buffered render now equals direct render). New tests: ImageGraphics2DTranslucentFillTests (straight result on straight and premultiplied buffers; a translucent fill and a partly covered edge on a transparent backbuffer composite like a direct draw; the fill honours the clipping rect) and MarkdownTableGridTests.StripedRowsPaintBetweenTheGridLines.","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"StoDevX/AAO-React-Native","commit_timestamp":"2026-10-03T15:47:40Z","branch":"master","commit_sha":"e1260ac93ab441456f6ed8c58b7f180f5132708c","github_link":"https://github.com/StoDevX/AAO-React-Native/commit/e1260ac93ab441456f6ed8c58b7f180f5132708c","commit_subject":"Add Support and Developer screens, and fill Home's menu","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"lowdefy/lowdefy","commit_timestamp":"2026-10-03T15:47:27Z","branch":"main","commit_sha":"0f1ec4f1d83e1e61f2fd8de9046f5aea3e47f82e","github_link":"https://github.com/lowdefy/lowdefy/commit/0f1ec4f1d83e1e61f2fd8de9046f5aea3e47f82e","commit_subject":"Merge #2553 (ci: Run the unit tests on Windows) into ci/v7-fast-ci","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"lowdefy/lowdefy","commit_timestamp":"2026-10-03T15:47:26Z","branch":"main","commit_sha":"ae66e446ca4a93bd937ba06